{"v":[{"a":["إِذَا","ٱلسَّمَآءُ","ٱنفَطَرَتۡ"],"t":"When the sky breaks apart","l":"Idha As-Sama'u Anfatarat","w":[["idhā","When"],["l-samāu","the sky"],["infaṭarat","(is) cleft asunder"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱلۡكَوَاكِبُ","ٱنتَثَرَتۡ"],"t":"When the planets are scattered","l":"Wa 'Idha Al-Kawakibu Antatharat","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["l-kawākibu","the stars"],["intatharat","scatter"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱلۡبِحَارُ","فُجِّرَتۡ"],"t":"When the oceans are exploded","l":"Wa 'Idha Al-Biharu Fujjirat","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["l-biḥāru","the seas"],["fujjirat","are made to gush forth"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱلۡقُبُورُ","بُعۡثِرَتۡ"],"t":"When the tombs are strewn around","l":"Wa 'Idha Al-Quburu Bu`thirat","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["l-qubūru","the graves"],["buʿ'thirat","are overturned"]]},{"a":["عَلِمَتۡ","نَفۡسٞ","مَّا","قَدَّمَتۡ","وَأَخَّرَتۡ"],"t":"Each soul will know what it has advanced, and what it has deferred","l":"Alimat Nafsun Ma Qaddamat Wa 'Akhkharat","w":[["ʿalimat","Will know"],["nafsun","a soul"],["mā","what"],["qaddamat","it has sent forth"],["wa-akharat","and left behind"]]},{"a":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","مَا","غَرَّكَ","بِرَبِّكَ","ٱلۡكَرِيمِ"],"t":"O man! What deluded you concerning your Lord, the Most Generous","l":"Ya 'Ayyuha Al-'Insanu Ma Gharraka Birabbika Al-Karimi","w":[["yāayyuhā","O"],["l-insānu","man"],["mā","What"],["gharraka","has deceived you"],["birabbika","concerning your Lord"],["l-karīmi","the Most Noble"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِي","خَلَقَكَ","فَسَوَّىٰكَ","فَعَدَلَكَ"],"t":"He Who created you, and formed you, and proportioned you","l":"Al-Ladhi Khalaqaka Fasawwaka Fa`adalaka","w":[["alladhī","Who"],["khalaqaka","created you"],["fasawwāka","then fashioned you"],["faʿadalaka","then balanced you"]]},{"a":["فِيٓ","أَيِّ","صُورَةٖ","مَّا","شَآءَ","رَكَّبَكَ"],"t":"In whatever shape He willed, He assembled you","l":"Fi 'Ayyi Suratin Ma Sha'a Rakkabaka","w":[["fī","In"],["ayyi","whatever"],["ṣūratin","form"],["mā","what"],["shāa","He willed"],["rakkabaka","He assembled you"]]},{"a":["كَلَّا","بَلۡ","تُكَذِّبُونَ","بِٱلدِّينِ"],"t":"But you reject the religion","l":"Kalla Bal Tukadhibuna Bid-Dini","w":[["kallā","Nay"],["bal","But"],["tukadhibūna","you deny"],["bil-dīni","the Judgment"]]},{"a":["وَإِنَّ","عَلَيۡكُمۡ","لَحَٰفِظِينَ"],"t":"Though over you are watchers","l":"Wa 'Inna `Alaykum Lahafizina","w":[["wa-inna","And indeed"],["ʿalaykum","over you"],["laḥāfiẓīna","(are) surely guardians"]]},{"a":["كِرَامٗا","كَٰتِبِينَ"],"t":"Honest recorders","l":"Kiramaan Katibina","w":[["kirāman","Noble"],["kātibīna","recording"]]},{"a":["يَعۡلَمُونَ","مَا","تَفۡعَلُونَ"],"t":"They know everything you do","l":"Ya`lamuna Ma Taf`aluna","w":[["yaʿlamūna","They know"],["mā","whatever"],["tafʿalūna","you do"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","ٱلۡأَبۡرَارَ","لَفِي","نَعِيمٖ"],"t":"The virtuous will be in bliss","l":"Inna Al-'Abrara Lafi Na`imin","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["l-abrāra","the righteous"],["lafī","(will be) surely in"],["naʿīmin","bliss"]]},{"a":["وَإِنَّ","ٱلۡفُجَّارَ","لَفِي","جَحِيمٖ"],"t":"While the wicked will be in Hell","l":"Wa 'Inna Al-Fujjara Lafi Jahimin","w":[["wa-inna","And indeed"],["l-fujāra","the wicked"],["lafī","(will be) surely in"],["jaḥīmin","Hellfire"]]},{"a":["يَصۡلَوۡنَهَا","يَوۡمَ","ٱلدِّينِ"],"t":"They will enter it on the Day of Justice","l":"Yaslawnaha Yawma Ad-Dini","w":[["yaṣlawnahā","They will burn (in) it"],["yawma","(on the) Day"],["l-dīni","(of) the Judgment"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","هُمۡ","عَنۡهَا","بِغَآئِبِينَ"],"t":"And they will not be absent from it","l":"Wa Ma Hum `Anha Bigha'ibina","w":[["wamā","And not"],["hum","they"],["ʿanhā","from it"],["bighāibīna","(will be) absent"]]},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","يَوۡمُ","ٱلدِّينِ"],"t":"But what will convey to you what the Day of Justice is","l":"Wa Ma 'Adraka Ma Yawmu Ad-Dini","w":[["wamā","And what"],["adrāka","can make you know"],["mā","what"],["yawmu","(is the) Day"],["l-dīni","(of) the Judgment"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","مَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","يَوۡمُ","ٱلدِّينِ"],"t":"Then again, what will convey to you what the Day of Justice is","l":"Thumma Ma 'Adraka Ma Yawmu Ad-Dini","w":[["thumma","Then"],["mā","what"],["adrāka","can make you know"],["mā","what"],["yawmu","(is the) Day"],["l-dīni","(of) the Judgment"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","لَا","تَمۡلِكُ","نَفۡسٞ","لِّنَفۡسٖ","شَيۡـٔٗاۖ","وَٱلۡأَمۡرُ","يَوۡمَئِذٖ","لِّلَّهِ"],"t":"The Day when no soul will avail another soul anything; and the decision on that Day is God’s","l":"Yawma La Tamliku Nafsun Linafsin Shay'aan Wa Al-'Amru Yawma'idhin Lillahi","w":[["yawma","(The) Day"],["lā","not"],["tamliku","will have power"],["nafsun","a soul"],["linafsin","for a soul"],["shayan","anything"],["wal-amru","and the Command"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["lillahi","(will be) with Allah"]]}]}